\ Two modules each define a `slot>>` getter for a different struct, and neither
\ imports the other, so the getters do not unify. Both are reachable and called.
\ Name-keyed AOT discovery would collapse them to one baked getter and misresolve
\ one call; per-caller-module-scoped discovery keeps each caller bound to its own
\ module's getter. Correct output proves both resolved to the right getter.
use "./support/coll_widget.1z" ;
use "./support/coll_gadget.1z" ;

widget-slot .
gadget-slot .
